<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. KLIC example; preserve bundled per-file license notices. -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="toast" data-kv-variant="file" data-klic-component="toast" class="kn-toast"><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="toast-show"  data-part="btn">알림 다시 표시</button><section data-kv-toast role="status" data-part="toast-box"><div><i data-part="icon" data-lucide="circle-check" aria-hidden="true"></i><header data-part="heading"><strong>파일 처리가 완료되었습니다</strong><p data-part="muted">프로젝트 자료 12개를 가져왔습니다.</p></header><details  data-part="details"><summary>처리 내역</summary><div><ul data-part="list"><li>가이드.pdf</li><li>명세.docx</li><li>리뷰.txt</li></ul></div></details></div><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="toast-close" aria-label="알림 닫기" data-part="btn">×</button></section></div>
